<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Hello Keyran users, this time I bring you this new combo that I created just yesterday; it is much more effective than the previous ones I have made and can be quite helpful for you."

Instructions:
"To use this combo, follow these steps carefully:

First, install the macro, of course.
Assign it to the control key, preferably.
Simply press the key when engaging with contra and high speed."</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 31 1
Delay 6
KeyUp 31 1
Delay 6
KeyDown 32 1
Delay 6
KeyUp 32 1
Delay 6
KeyDown 33 1
Delay 6
